# Core Product Features (Messaging)

When describing the product, focus on these features:

### Element Capture

Developers can click any element on a webpage and capture it.

### Style Extraction

The tool reconstructs the visual appearance using:

- computed styles
- resolved CSS variables
- inline layout

### Asset Handling

Captured elements preserve:

- images
- SVG
- background images
- layout context

### Snippet Library

Captured UI components can be stored in a reusable library.

### AI Integration

Snippets can be referenced by AI tools using an MCP server. This allows developers to reuse captured UI in tools like Cursor.

