# Hero Section Rules

All marketing pages must follow this structure.

## Hero Headline

```
Capture UI from any site and rebuild it with AI.
```

## Supporting Line

```
Clean. Clear. Powerful.
```

## Primary CTA (Chrome Web Store)

The default primary CTA on marketing pages and site chrome (header, hero, bottom CTA block, footer top row when shown) is:

```
Add to Chrome - It's Free
```

Render **Free** with semantic emphasis (`<strong>` or equivalent) and `font-weight` from design tokens—not plain text for the whole line.

Do not use alternate install CTAs as the default (e.g. `Install`, `Install the extension`, or `Add to Chrome` alone) unless a page has a documented exception.

Avoid generic CTAs like:

```
Learn More
Get Started Today
```

