# UI Copy Rules

UI text should be concise.

Preferred style:

```
Capture Element
Save Snippet
Copy HTML
Copy JSX
```

Avoid long UI labels.

**Bad example:**

```
Click here to capture the currently selected element
```

**Good example:**

```
Capture Element
```

